<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Vérification de certificat — Talentos</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/font/bootstrap-icons.css">
<style>
  *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  body {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    min-height: 100vh;
    background: #0f172a;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 24px;
    background-image:
      radial-gradient(circle at 20% 20%, rgba(79,70,229,0.15) 0%, transparent 50%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 80% 80%, rgba(6,182,212,0.1) 0%, transparent 50%);
  }

  .card {
    background: #1e293b;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    border-radius: 24px;
    padding: 48px 40px;
    max-width: 520px;
    width: 100%;
    text-align: center;
    box-shadow: 0 32px 80px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
  }

  .badge-valid {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
    background: rgba(16,185,129,0.15);
    border: 1px solid rgba(16,185,129,0.4);
    color: #10b981;
    border-radius: 50px;
    padding: 8px 20px;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }
  .badge-invalid {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
    background: rgba(239,68,68,0.15);
    border: 1px solid rgba(239,68,68,0.4);
    color: #ef4444;
    border-radius: 50px;
    padding: 8px 20px;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }

  .icon-circle {
    width: 100px; height: 100px; border-radius: 50%;
    margin: 0 auto 24px;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    font-size: 2.8rem;
  }
  .icon-valid   { background: rgba(16,185,129,0.15); }
  .icon-invalid { background: rgba(239,68,68,0.15); }

  h1 { font-size: 1.6rem; font-weight: 800; color: #f1f5f9; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .subtitle { color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 32px; line-height: 1.6; }

  .info-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .info-item {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 14px 16px;
  }
  .info-label {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    color: #64748b;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .info-value {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #e2e8f0;
  }

  .score-big {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 2px;
  }

  .logo {
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: #4f46e5;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="card">

  <div class="logo">⚡ TALENTOS</div>

  {% if not valid or not user or not formation %}
    <div class="icon-circle icon-invalid">❌</div>
    <div class="badge-invalid"><i class="bi bi-shield-x"></i> Certificat invalide</div>
    <h1>Certificat non valide</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">
      Ce certificat n'a pas pu être vérifié. Il est possible qu'il ait été modifié ou que l'utilisateur n'ait pas atteint le score requis.
    </p>
  {% else %}
    <div class="icon-circle icon-valid">🏆</div>
    <div class="badge-valid"><i class="bi bi-patch-check-fill"></i> Certificat authentique</div>
    <h1>Certificat vérifié</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">
      Ce certificat est authentique et a été délivré par la plateforme <strong style="color:#e2e8f0">Talentos</strong>.
    </p>

    <div class="info-grid">
      <div class="info-item" style="grid-column:1/-1">
        <div class="info-label">Titulaire du certificat</div>
        <div class="info-value" style="font-size:1.05rem;color:#a5b4fc">
          {% if user.profile is defined and user.profile and user.profile.firstName is defined %}
            {{ user.profile.firstName }} {{ user.profile.lastName ?? '' }}
          {% else %}
            {{ user.email }}
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="info-item" style="grid-column:1/-1">
        <div class="info-label">Formation</div>
        <div class="info-value">{{ formation.titre }}</div>
      </div>

      <div class="info-item">
        <div class="info-label">Score moyen</div>
        <div class="score-big" style="color:{{ avgScore >= 14 ? '#10b981' : '#f59e0b' }}">
          {{ avgScore }}<span style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:600;color:#64748b">/20</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="info-item">
        <div class="info-label">Réussite</div>
        <div class="score-big" style="color:{{ avgPercent >= 70 ? '#10b981' : '#f59e0b' }}">
          {{ avgPercent }}<span style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:600;color:#64748b">%</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      {% if date %}
      <div class="info-item" style="grid-column:1/-1">
        <div class="info-label">Date d'obtention</div>
        <div class="info-value">{{ date|date('d/m/Y') }}</div>
      </div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>

    <div style="background:rgba(16,185,129,0.08);border:1px solid rgba(16,185,129,0.2);
                border-radius:12px;padding:14px;font-size:0.82rem;color:#94a3b8;line-height:1.6">
      <i class="bi bi-shield-check" style="color:#10b981;margin-right:6px"></i>
      Ce certificat confirme que l'apprenant a réussi la formation avec une moyenne d'au moins <strong style="color:#10b981">70%</strong>.
    </div>
  {% endif %}

  <div style="margin-top:28px;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
              font-size:0.75rem;color:#475569">
    Vérifié par la plateforme Talentos — {{ 'now'|date('d/m/Y H:i') }}
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
